text = "\" I always knew you were full of bullsquid. 

You are out of fuel. 

You are out of time.

And you are out of luck. 

Goodbye, fisher-boy. \"


Glorp swallows you whole.

You slowly descend, 
inky black blood coursing through your veins,
and flames baptizing your feet.

You are in hell.

Game over.


